Patch 04 (repro-cops): missing script for the catmix800 primal (_snap) evaluation.

Problem: logs/catmix800_primal_snap.{json,txt} (the catmix800 primal value -0.0480559013308475
quoted in the wave-2 report) were produced by an inline python snippet that was never saved.
Fix: add explore/catmix_primal_snap_eval.py, the snippet recovered from the wave-2 agent
transcript. Rerun after explore/catmix_primal_snap.py 800 2e-3, it rewrites both files
byte-identically to the committed ones.  Apply:  git apply 04-add-catmix-snap-eval-script.patch

diff --git a/research-20260929/open-instances-wave2/cops/explore/catmix_primal_snap_eval.py b/research-20260929/open-instances-wave2/cops/explore/catmix_primal_snap_eval.py
